ded by women  forbes has written about how there's a  movement to change this called all raise  more and more women in venture capital  looking to fund companies  that are founded or co-founded by women  so i think it's a matter of time where  we'll eventually see more women  billionaires especially self-made  billionaires on this list  [Music]
 

